  "details": "   * Update the bundled timezone data to tzdata2026c, exactly as in\n     OpenJDK 11.0.33 (jdk-11.0.33+8); backported from the upstream jdk11u release\n     repository together with the CLDR metazone changes it depends on:\n     - JDK-8380223: Refactor test/jdk/sun/util/resources TestNG tests\n       to JUnit (test-only prerequisite)\n     - JDK-8381379: Support std/dstOffset attributes in CLDR's metazone\n       definitions\n     - JDK-8390388: Cherry-pick tz attributes from newer CLDR data\n     - JDK-8390380: Cherry-pick metazone changes from CLDR to support\n       tzdata2026c\n     - JDK-8388214: (tz) Update Timezone Data to 2026c\n     - JDK-8391256: TestZoneTextPrinterParser.java assertion fails\n     - JDK-8391807: Inconsistent TimeZone Names Displayed across JDK\n       release trains",
